@startuml
title Successful parsing: set-diet diet/vegan
autonumber
participant "parser: Parser" as Parser
participant "dietParser: DietaryPreferencesParser" as DP
participant "<u>Diet</u>" as Diet
participant "preferences: DietaryPreferences" as Preferences
participant "command: SetDietCommand" as Command
[-> Parser : parseCommand(input)
activate Parser
note over Parser : Dispatch through parseNamedCommand is condensed.
Parser -> Parser : parseSetDiet("diet/vegan")
create DP
Parser -> DP : new DietaryPreferencesParser()
Parser -> DP : parse("diet/vegan")
activate DP
DP -> DP : collectFields(arguments)
DP -> Diet : parse("vegan")
Diet --> DP : VEGAN
create Preferences
DP -> Preferences : new DietaryPreferences(VEGAN, emptyTags, emptyIngredients)
note right of Preferences : Copy and validate exclusion sets.
DP --> Parser : preferences
deactivate DP
create Command
Parser -> Command : new SetDietCommand(preferences, settings, activePlan, generator)
note right of Command : Creates a DietaryPlanner internally.
Parser -->[ : command as Command
deactivate Parser
legend bottom
  Parsing has no session-state side effects. Constructor internals are condensed.
  Dashed arrows are returns. Underlined Diet denotes static method calls.
endlegend
@enduml

